WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Verona, sixteenth-century Italy.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Two noble houses, Montague and Capulet, have fought for generations.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Their servants brawl in the market square.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The Prince threatens death to anyone who disturbs the peace again.
